OL,3,GNEWSAAlert over Christmas rail
OL,4,Adisruption through Redhill
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers travelling through
OL,7,FRedhill over Christmas and New Year are
OL,8,Furged to plan ahead as major
OL,9,Fengineering work will close parts of
OL,10,Fthe railway.
OL,12,FNetwork Rail said more than one mile of
OL,13,Ftrack would be replaced as part of a
OL,14,F#31.7m programme of upgrades across the
OL,15,Fsouthern region.
OL,17,FFrom 20 December until 3 January,
OL,18,Ftrains will continue to run on fast
OL,19,Flines but all services that would
OL,20,Fnormally stop at Redhill station itself
OL,21,Fwill be replaced by buses.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
